{"id":722,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Flies noiselessly on delicate wings. It has mastered the art of deftly launching dagger-sharp feathers from those same wings."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"During the day, it builds up energy via photosynthesis. At night, it flies silently through the sky, on the prowl for prey."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"At a distance, it launches its sharp feathers while flying about. If the enemy gets too close, Rowlet switches tactics and delivers vicious kicks."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It feels relaxed in tight, dark places and has been known to use its Trainer’s pocket or bag as a nest."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It sends its feathers, which are as sharp as blades, flying in attack. Its legs are strong, so its kicks are also formidable."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Silently it glides, drawing near its targets. Before they even notice it, it begins to pelt them with vicious kicks."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"This wary Pokémon uses photosynthesis to store up energy during the day, while becoming active at night."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Overgrow","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Grass-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Long Reach","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon uses its moves without making contact with the target."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":722,"name":"Rowlet","condition":null,"children":[{"id":723,"name":"Dartrix","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":724,"name":"Decidueye","condition":"Lv. 34 or Lv. 36, in Hisui","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[3,670],[6,310],[9,64],[12,425],[15,75],[18,235],[21,365],[24,417],[27,389],[30,348],[33,297],[36,413]],"machine":[332,314,403,413,331,109,814,203,412,263,206,297,202,447,520,803,580,114,270,282,437,113,345,417,101,182,240,156,402,421,214,76,164,